{"version":1,"key":"card:429","content":{"id":429,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"15491dc5-68a1-4a73-a3de-13e14b3c8d38","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"米的定义的演变历史："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"f08f12b7-c59d-49c1-885a-eaacc8c85176","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"465728b7-b828-4598-b283-3284c73fae0f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f588716d-1de4-4876-807e-4547400a72e5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1795 年法国科学院对米进行了定义：赤道到北极点的海平面子午线的长度而定，一米为这个子午线长度的一千万分之一。但该种定义存在的问题是地球的并不是静止不动的，人为或者非人为的地貌改变都可能会改变测量的长度。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a757a8c1-85d8-4761-ba10-7857240fdae7","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a9e02a84-9d03-4315-a4e8-8a878eda4a0f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1960 年，第 11 届度量大会上重新定义了米重新定义了米：﻿"},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"^{86}\\text{Kr}","collabId":"4f6f8943-caca-406b-b255-672f87a9163e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"86"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 原子的 2p10 和 5d5 能级之间跃迁所对应的辐射在真空中的波长的 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"1 650 763.73","collabId":"d5b21d82-0a2e-4b98-b57d-a05fd8cf3209","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1 650 763.73"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 倍，其复现不确定度可以达到 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"2.7×10^{-8}","collabId":"13ba504d-ce43-4439-ada4-1078fcaa6176","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2.7×10-8"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9445924e-b87a-47ac-82ca-136824abe5f4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"^{86}\\text{Kr}","collabId":"4dc114c9-b1fe-4b40-975f-aa20c6ed3e5f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"86"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 原子橙黄谱线具有最窄和最对称的辐射谱线，能在最小扰动下产生，并可用其他方法测量。这一单色光谱线的波长值只与其辐射频率和真空中的光速有关。如果光速为定值，则波长就是不随时间变化、可在任何时间、任何地点复现的值，适于作为新定义的自然量标准。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"eed34317-e586-4cbc-b356-aa53226a7c6d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"94a8357a-9ddb-4a95-b871-619e51f093d9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1983 年，由于 ﻿"},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"^{86}\\text{Kr}","collabId":"893d8d7d-dd53-4a50-a073-96b97eaa4953","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"86"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不易取得，且光速的测定也已非常精确，所以将米与光速进行挂钩，定义为真空中光在 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\dfrac{1}{299792458}","collabId":"bff357c0-602c-41d3-804d-fcce98a001fd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\dfrac{1}{299792458}"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 秒内传播的距离。这一定义利用了秒定义的高度准确性和固定的真空中光速值("},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"c = \\dfrac{λ}{f} = 299 792 458 \\, \\text{m/s}","collabId":"aa78bf1a-2844-4cb8-9d50-572d16b9b07a","children":[{"type":"fo